descriptions.job-0xpz9y2:
&lt;h3&gt;About the Position&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Sales and Trading intern, you’ll work alongside our experienced Sales people and&amp;nbsp;Sales-Traders, learning how we engage and cover institutional clients on their trading needs in&amp;nbsp;the different asset classes that we cover. They’ll offer insight into the types of client inquiries we&amp;nbsp;handle daily, and you’ll learn how we service our clients, issuers, and prospective clients. The&amp;nbsp;internship is a fast-paced, immersive experience, and you will attend internal classes on various&amp;nbsp;topics where we can teach you the broader fundamentals of finance and trading.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About You&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don’t expect you to have a background in one specific field - we’re looking for smart, driven people who would enjoy working with clients to solve interesting problems. We’re more interested in how you think and learn than what you currently know. You should be:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Studying towards a Bachelor’s or Master’s degree, coming into or having completed your final year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, reliable, and courteous with strong interpersonal, team working and communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A self-motivated and entrepreneurial problem-solver who is excited about building relationships with our clients and partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A highly analytical and logical thinker, comfortable working with numbers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extremely organised with excellent attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in learning&amp;nbsp; SQL and/or Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English, with proficiency in Spanish, Italian, French, Portuguese or German is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note: Jane Street will provide flights to and from London as well as accommodation throughout the entirety of the program.&lt;/p&gt;

descriptions.job-1hptv6i:
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-JtcUds33tou2bExMj4DluIpngwb&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WrPKdi25aoGh2Bx7T03lyXQDgzy&quot;&gt;At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YrZYdLOCronaoTxpsdnlDb8sgeh&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M8AYdy9lRoviKMxjCGMlpXU4gEd&quot;&gt;OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AWZWd6akgoWQFVx5MPclR7JZg6g&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GX6qd72HIoARPKxHbS1ltgjVgJf&quot;&gt;Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles:&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Tt5qdGgb8oHpsgxAlcXlWZyygse&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RgcEdS2qVou3ezx9F4slGgDWgZf&quot;&gt;OKX is part of OKG, a group that brings the value of Blockchain to users around the world, through our leading products OKX, OKX Wallet, OKLink and more.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U0oTdVJ9No0kJTxq66vlDJFEgHc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RhMsdCuj1omiRDxcjXwlAhZxgAb&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RhMsdCuj1omiRDxcjXwlAhZxgAb&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;HAGed4CtDotlHMx8GUZlH5hZgsX&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CL94dEUNLoQa6Xxph2elt4uXgeb&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LuZudFQn8oqbJXxwS8LlOcIdg1q&quot;&gt;OKX is seeking an experienced and highly capable Senior Manager to develop OKX&#39;s partnerships with token projects and on-chain ecosystems globally. The core responsibilities of this role include: (1) partnering with high-potential early-stage blockchain and token projects through launch support and reward campaigns, (2) developing partnerships with tokenization platforms and other key players for RWA projects, and (3) expanding the ecosystem partnership around X Layer, OKX&#39;s on-chain network.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Evtnd9OH3o2FuCxETVelsSs9gnc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YRKTdRXmDoj2yWxgOrDlz3tOgXf&quot;&gt;This position requires strategic judgment, comfort with ambiguity, and strong execution - combining market insight, professionalism, and cross-functional leadership.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RhMsdCuj1omiRDxcjXwlAhZxgAb&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-FRdedJMVFoJAVyxFUySlOihYgNg&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;HAGed4CtDotlHMx8GUZlH5hZgsX&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KRmYdrS9LoBQF9xqEdplRjPHgeg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Source, evaluate, and negotiate collaboration opportunities with high-potential early-stage Web3 projects across sectors (Web3, AI, infrastructure, etc.) and partnerships for RWA initiatives, owning end-to-end project and relationship management, and coordinating with internal teams on follow-on opportunities across OKX&#39;s ecosystem.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vaoqdr13Pob33DxmZFBlNRkDgrf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Drive ecosystem growth on X Layer by building collaborations and overseeing deployments with partners (e.g. activation programs and campaigns).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WVYKdp6v2ozXrNx7As7lXiJDgzg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
