&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;EvdSd60EYorG6VxK4VOlUlAsgwh&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-JqntdOPkjoel5pxRTWjlmkT4gIh&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P5D0dbE67o55smx4BJSl54GWg2d&quot;&gt;At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom. OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles: We Before Me, Do the Right Thing, and Get Things Done. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er. OKX is part of OKG, a group that brings the value of Blockchain to users around the world, through our leading products OKX, OKX Wallet, OKLink and more.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-CD7zdvlcXoCh8qxk6qblRsllgSd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RGKad0lyRoYby2xCCqdlYYJ0gAc&quot;&gt;OKX’s Legal team provides legal advice and guidance to the Company across all coverage areas and geographic locations, and supports business growth and development by working with all teams within the company to help them achieve their goals. We are a high-functioning, collaborative, and fast-paced team who enjoys the cutting-edge nature of our work and our industry.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-PUYqdcvywoWRUIx2oPNlykTHgah&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IZv9djsp3oM7h8xQT4ll9vMCg0g&quot;&gt;As a Senior Legal Analyst, you will report to the Deputy General Counsel and work closely with all members of the legal team and business leaders throughout the company.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G2jodfkhAod4WJxJokIl5M03gQe&quot;&gt;The right candidate will have strong, prior contract management experience working with a variety of internal stakeholders and various business teams providing general legal support to a diverse and global organization. They should also have strong interpersonal skills, sound judgment and decision-making skills, the ability and desire to work collaboratively with a high-functioning legal team, and ideally, an interest in the cryptocurrency and fintech industries.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-B1GhdLwn3o5BTAx3d2elhv54gjX&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RugVd1W5MoaVT6xfesblV9tUgff&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draft, review, and negotiate contracts, including, but not limited to, NDAs, Master Service Agreements, Statements of Work, Data Processing Agreements, marketing services agreements, and amendments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with business stakeholders and vendors to negotiate and execute contracts that are key to OKX&#39;s future growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply OKX&#39;s SOP or design new SOPs to support OKX&#39;s commercial objectives while following applicable regulations and otherwise managing legal and regulatory risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain organised records of contracts and various legal documents across multiple group entities and jurisdictions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with business units and legal team members to design, develop, and implement legal processes, training programmes, internal guidelines, and playbooks to drive efficiencies and build for scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with special projects as needed.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-OCsPd1dSCoMrZRxgUSRlpJ9RgCc&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For In You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NIvedxSXio0NMWxklCql1iS7gjd&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or above from an accredited college or university; a law degree (LLB, JD, or equivalent) is strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Candidates without a law degree but with substantial prior law firm and/or in-house paralegal/legal analyst experience will also be considered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to independently develop and implement various legal processes, policies, and playbooks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to thrive in a fast-paced environment where priorities shift rapidly while maintaining accuracy and sound legal judgement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across multiple jurisdictions and with cross-border commercial agreements is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical skills, attention to detail, and sound commercial judgment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and oral communication skills in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with contract lifecycle management platforms (e.g. Ironclad) and e-signature tools (e.g. Docusign) is preferred.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-Xtw0d22Bzoy8BSxmZl7lGVqkg0c&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perks &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S5CPdL2f1oZR07xUiEGlmC2CgPe&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive total compensation package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;L&amp;amp;D programs and education subsidy for employees&#39; growth and development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Various team building programs and company events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Syu0d85MGoiNUYxtfqwl9YZ6gQg&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
