descriptions.job-1n6kt3u:
&lt;h3&gt;About the Position&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an Exotic Options Trader based in NYC to work closely with our local and global options teams. In this role, you&#39;ll price complex derivatives, identify trading opportunities, and strategically manage relationships with our sell-side counterparties.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exotic options trading at Jane Street sits at the intersection of our single stock and index options businesses. You&#39;ll collaborate closely with colleagues across products and regions, contributing to idea generation, model development, and strategic positioning. Partnering with sell-side counterparts is a core part of the business, and we are looking for someone who can cultivate these relationships and help us access flow we might otherwise miss.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a culture of strong collaboration both across teams and across regions, and are actively expanding our exotic options trading capabilities. We&#39;re looking for someone who brings deep product knowledge and market intuition to the team. Your understanding of complex payoffs, ability to price quickly and accurately, and willingness to push us in new directions will be instrumental in our continued growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Trading team is full of highly motivated professionals who have created a culture of trust, respect, and collaboration. Your working relationships, trader intuition, and ability to analyze special situations will add value to our team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About You&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-6 years of experience in exotic options trading&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong quantitative skills in pricing complex derivatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the sell-side landscape and a track record of building productive counterparty relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to think critically and implement new ideas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced teaching others and open to learning new techniques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communicator with excellent planning, analytical, and people skills; comfortable coordinating across time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reliable and flexible team player with a positive attitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented, organized, and thorough, with a desire for continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to spend multiple weeks a year traveling to London and Hong Kong is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job__description body&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you&#39;re a recruiting agency and want to partner with us, please reach out to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;agency-partnerships@janestreet.com&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-1axd862:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Ripple, we’re building a world where value moves like information does today. It’s big, it’s bold, and we’re already doing it. Through our crypto solutions for financial institutions, businesses, governments and developers, we are improving the global financial system and creating greater economic fairness and opportunity for more people, in more places around the world. And we get to do the best work of our career and grow our skills surrounded by colleagues who have our backs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If you’re ready to see your impact and unlock incredible career growth opportunities, join us, and build real world value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be part of:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Ripple, we’re building a world where value moves like information does today. It’s big, it’s bold, and we’re already doing it. Through our crypto solutions for financial institutions, businesses, governments and developers, we are improving the global financial system and creating greater economic fairness and opportunity for more people, in more places around the world. And we get to do the best work of our career and grow our skills surrounded by colleagues who have our backs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re ready to see your impact and unlock incredible career growth opportunities, join us, and build real world value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be responsible for:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring a Senior Ecosystem Growth Manager to grow the ecosystem building on the XRP Ledger (XRPL) and accelerate real-world adoption of Ripple’s crypto solutions. Your primary focus is growing the community of startups and founders building on XRPL. VCs, accelerators, and corporates are the channels and partners you work through to find and support that ecosystem. This is a strategic, hands-on role at the center of our top theses and core product pillars: cross-border payments, stablecoins, and FX; lending, yield, and credit; AI and agentic payments; and institutional use cases spanning capital markets and collateral mobility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a traditional business development or venture role. You’ll define ecosystem strategy, influence product direction, architect partnerships, and create market adoption across these value chains. You’ll be the first call for founders building on XRPL, and for the strategic partners who shape where the market goes: VCs, top accelerators, and market participants. You’ll do it with real autonomy and the backing of a global team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Emerging markets are among our highest-conviction opportunities, and Latin America is a strategic market for this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll work on:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Source and build the ecosystem&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Source and build a high-quality pipeline through warm, vetted channels across VCs, accelerators, corporates, and strategic partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a portfolio of tier-one relationships (VCs and LPs, corporates, accelerators, and key conferences) that keeps XRPL top of mind, drives introductions across founders, investors, and partners, and shapes the direction of the market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Map end-to-end value chains across our focus pillars to pinpoint the participants, dependencies, and gaps that accelerate real-world adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect the dots across the ecosystem, making introductions between founders, investors, and partners that unlock growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structure and close deals&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own deals end to end, from first conversation to a signed grant, partnership, or investment, originating, evaluating, structuring, and closing the opportunities that compound Ripple’s network position&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design deal terms and milestones that align incentives and drive adoption, deploying capital where it accelerates Ripple’s growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quarterback each deal to signature, then hand off smoothly into delivery and stay connected to help partners reach go-live&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape strategy and the market&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sharpen Ripple’s value proposition and market signal, making the path into the XRPL and Ripple ecosystems clear and easy to work with across channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn market signals, competitive dynamics, and regulatory developments into sharp, recommendation-forward narratives that influence founders, partners, and RippleX leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Engineering, BD, Corp Dev, DevRel, and Go-to-Market to qualify opportunities, sharpen strategic priorities, and influence the product roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pressure-test growth strategies and make clear tradeoff calls across competing priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring to Ripple:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Requirements:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years in business development, strategic partnerships, corporate strategy, or venture capital across enterprise fintech, financial services, payments, or treasury technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building commercial opportunities from ambiguous, zero-to-one starting points without an existing playbook&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong, active network across fintech, payments, and crypto, with genuine relationships at the operator, founder, and fund level, the kind of person who gets the call before a deal is public&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A sophisticated understanding of both blockchain and traditional financial services, and a genuine passion for crypto&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meticulous, methodical, creative, and thorough in your analysis and problem-solving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A clear, direct communicator who can influence senior executives internally and externally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable navigating ambiguity with autonomy and accountability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in New York, Miami, London, or São Paulo, or willing to relocate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Requirements:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience in one or more of our focus pillars: cross-border payments, stablecoins, FX, lending and credit, or agentic payments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the XRP Ledger and RLUSD&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in emerging markets; fluency in a Latin American market or language a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing relationships with tier-one VCs, accelerators, or market makers in fintech or crypto&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;For positions that will be based in NY, the annual salary range for this position is below. Actual salaries may vary based on numerous factors including, among other things, an individual applicant’s experience and qualifications for the position. This range does not include equity or additional compensation, such as bonuses or commissions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NY Annual Base Salary Range&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;$192,000&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;—&lt;/span&gt;$230,000 USD&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO WE ARE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Do Your Best Work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The opportunity to build in a fast-paced start-up environment with experienced industry leaders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A learning environment where you can dive deep into the latest technologies and make an impact.&amp;nbsp; A professional development budget to support other modes of learning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Thrive in an environment where no matter what race, ethnicity, gender, origin, or culture they identify with, every employee is a respected, valued, and empowered part of the team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;In-office collaboration for moments that matter is important to our culture, and we give managers and teams the flexibility to decide which 10+ days a month they come in.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Bi-weekly all-company meeting - business updates and ask me anything style discussion with our Leadership Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We come together for moments that matter which include team offsites, team bonding activities, happy hours and more!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Take Control of Your Finances&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive salary, bonuses, and equity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive benefits that cover physical and mental healthcare, retirement, family forming, and family support&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Employee giving match&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Mobile phone stipend&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Take Care of Yourself&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;R&amp;amp;R days so you can rest and recharge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous wellness reimbursement and weekly onsite &amp;amp; virtual programming&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous vacation policy - work with your manager to take time off when you need it&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Industry-leading parental leave policies. Family planning benefits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Catered lunches, fully-stocked kitchens with premium snacks/beverages, and plenty of fun events&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Benefits listed above are for full-time employees.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
