&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VG5UdkPeXogC3UxZaCkuCzvHsId&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Entrepreneurial mindset: Experience working in a fast-paced environment with competing resources and priorities. Opinionated and willing to make calls with limited information. Ability to navigate through ambiguity to advocate for resources&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GqdFdgPpQoRVowxLYCiujklIsUd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
