&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BdfGdWmKtoLvdlx2dw1uulKbsvd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Technical, comfortable with delving into the product, the platform and the implementation details. Able to engage with engineering beyond just product and user experience needs; willing to roll up sleeves and design scalable and extensible solutions&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L11wdQuHio6gcGxLrHQuzI4wsrh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Metrics driven with proficiency in identifying, defining, tracking and acting upon metrics Experience identifying KPIs and working with engineering and analytics on instrumentation and monitoring&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZCB2dP3DBoXXQExYzHSuBiHbsre&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Familiarity with cryptocurrency exchanges and passion for crypto and blockchain innovations&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QSMYd1vkAo0WDvxB16VuQzyJste&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
